{'symbol': 'ECL', 'date': '2023-03-21 16:45:00', 'title': 'ECOLAB SURVEY REVEALS HIGH EXPECTATIONS FOR WATER CONSERVATION', 'text': 'ST. PAUL, MINN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NEW DATA FROM A GLOBAL SURVEY CONDUCTED AND COMMISSIONED BY ECOLAB, A GLOBAL SUSTAINABILITY LEADER OFFERING WATER, HYGIENE AND INFECTION PREVENTION SOLUTIONS AND SERVICES, HAS REVEALED HIGH CONSUMER EXPECTATIONS FOR THE ROLE OF COMPANIES IN WATER ACCESS AND CONSERVATION. THE WATER, SUSTAINABILITY AND CLIMATE CHANGE SURVEY CONSULTED THOUSANDS OF CONSUMERS ACROSS EIGHT DIFFERENT COUNTRIES.'}